	"data": "Spatial Authoring Environment\n\nBuild apps and experiences FROM WITHIN VR by grabbing nodes, connecting them in 3D space, and assembling logic spatially. The vault is the data model. The Quest 3 is the canvas. The fiction is the spec.\n\nVision\n\nA spatial authoring environment running on Quest 3 in Godot that unifies ThoughtBubbles, skill trees, and Room 2.0 into one tool you use from inside VR. You reach out, grab a thought bubble, place it in space, connect it to another with a gesture, and…",
